<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>This portfolio presents professional and personal history. Its contact form is currently unavailable.</p>
<h2>Theme preference</h2><p>The light and dark theme control saves your choice in your browser's local storage under the key “theme.” You can remove that preference by clearing this site's browser storage.</p>
<h2>External links</h2><p>Links to LinkedIn, GitHub, and other services take you to sites with their own privacy practices. This portfolio does not submit contact messages to those services.</p>
<h2>Hosting</h2><p>The hosting infrastructure may process technical request information. The application notice above describes the features implemented in this portfolio; it does not describe every hosting provider's logging or retention settings.</p>
